# >>> Instructor page (password-gated) >>>
# instructor.qmd is the PLAINTEXT source of the gated Instructor page: it carries the
# links to the instructor notebooks (full solutions), the quiz banks, and the midterm
# cases in the private companion repo. It must NEVER be readable in this public repo.
# Its backup copy lives in the private companion repo (site/instructor.qmd).
/instructor.qmd
# Local clone of that private companion repo (working copy, never public).
# No trailing slash on purpose: the rule then matches even before the clone
# exists, so `git check-ignore -v _instructor_repo` confirms the guard is live.
_instructor_repo
# NOTE (do not "fix" this): docs/instructor.html is deliberately NOT ignored. That file
# is the ENCRYPTED build output produced by the post-render step, and publishing it is
# the whole point. Ignoring it would silently take the Instructor page off the site.
# <<< Instructor page (password-gated) <<<

# Keep docs for GitHub Pages
!docs/

# Temporary
*.tmp
*.bak
.scratch/

**/*.quarto_ipynb
